From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 17/23] platform: padre: add the GM0 Gigabit Ethernet driver

Ported from the GPL 2.6.17 gmac driver (validated there) to the 6.18
net_device API: MAC address from boot_param, descriptors in the
uncached S3 SRAM as 2.6.17 did, Marvell 88E1111 PHY over MDIO (the
ICS clock generator is set through padre_i2c). No NAPI and no hardware
checksum yet.
---
 drivers/platform/padre/Kconfig      |   7 +
 drivers/platform/padre/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/platform/padre/padre_gmac.c | 905 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 913 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/platform/padre/padre_gmac.c

